WEBVTT

00:00:29.793 --> 00:00:33.630
such as "Bonnie and Clyde" and "Oklahoma,"

00:00:33.630 --> 00:00:35.566
that was a little OK.

00:00:35.566 --> 00:00:38.435
But I remember one evening
coming across a show.

00:00:39.036 --> 00:00:40.203
It was an old movie,

00:00:40.237 --> 00:00:42.439
and it must have been "White Christmas"

00:00:42.472 --> 00:00:44.274
or “Holiday Inn” or that type.

00:00:44.308 --> 00:00:45.909
But it was a musical.

00:00:45.943 --> 00:00:48.178
And I started watching,

00:00:48.211 --> 00:00:51.381
and then they started
to do this musical scene,

00:00:51.415 --> 00:00:55.218
and I noticed I saw
Bing Crosby in blackface.

00:00:55.252 --> 00:00:56.887
And I was confused.

00:00:56.920 --> 00:00:59.656
I couldn't quite understand

00:00:59.690 --> 00:01:03.060
what the blackface had to do
with the singing and dancing.